{"id":"c28afa0be13172de6f87e10eb824f0b2accff7aa","axis":"silent","repo":"pnpm/pnpm","sha":"c28afa0be13172de6f87e10eb824f0b2accff7aa","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/registry-flag-reaches-pnpm-pin.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+---","+\"pacquet\": patch","+---","+","+`--registry`, `--https-proxy`, `--http-proxy`, and `--no-proxy` now apply when pnpm resolves and downloads the pnpm version a project pins in `packageManager`. Before, these lookups went to `https://registry.npmjs.org/`, which a firewall that only allows a private registry blocks [#16911](https://github.com/pnpm/pnpm/discussions/16911)."],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/cli_command.rs","lines":["@@ -195,7 +195,7 @@ pub struct CliPathArgs {","     pub workspace_packages: Vec<String>,"," }"," ","-#[derive(Debug, Clone, clap::Args)]","+#[derive(Debug, Default, Clone, clap::Args)]"," pub struct CliNetworkArgs {","     /// Base URL of the npm registry to resolve and fetch packages from.","     /// Universal rc-option: accepted on every command and layered onto"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/pre_command.rs","lines":["@@ -13,7 +13,7 @@ pub(crate) use execute::execute_plan;"," mod system_runtime_version;"," "," use super::{","-    cli_command::{CliArgs, CliCommand},","+    cli_command::{CliArgs, CliCommand, CliNetworkArgs},","     config::{ConfigLocation, ConfigSubcommand},","     install::{InstallArgs, resolve_bool_override},","     lockfile_dir::LockfileDirArg,"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/src/cli_args/pre_command/input.rs","lines":["@@ -4,9 +4,10 @@ mod argv_scan;"," mod reporter_flags;"," "," use super::{","-    ArgTable, CliArgs, CliCommand, ColorMode, Config, ConfigLocation, ConfigSubcommand,","-    InstallArgs, LockfileDirArg, LogEvent, OsStr, OsString, PACKAGE_MANAGER_SWITCH_ENV_VARS, Path,","-    PathBuf, ReporterFlags, pre_command_emit, resol